#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/1-robot_descriptions.md:12
#: a4865e4df987468181e4c039fdab3ce4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Description-side Cursor skills: **`feature/agilex` only** (`split-"
"chassis-glb`) — [Add a "
"Robot](../../2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md). **`main` has no "
"`.cursor/skills`**. Newer AgileX / Rokae INEX rows: [README on "
"`feature/agilex`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/README.md). **Taku** is in-"
"tree on that branch at `humanoid/Dyna/taku_description` ([package "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md)"
" §3.1 / §3.2); meshes under `meshes/{chassis,body,head,arm,dynaclaw}/`. "
"Control is `split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` with "
"`robot:=taku`, not `demo.launch.py`. It is not on `main` and is not a row"
" in that branch’s brand tables."
msgstr ""
"描述侧 Cursor skill：**仅 `feature/agilex`**（`split-chassis-glb`）— "
"[添加机器人](../../2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md)。**`main` 没有 "
"`.cursor/skills`**。更新的 AgileX / 珞石 INEX "
"行：[README（`feature/agilex`）](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/README.md)。**Taku** 在该分支仓内 "
"`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description`（[包 README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md)"
" §3.1 / §3.2）；网格在 `meshes/{chassis,body,head,arm,dynaclaw}/`。控制用 "
"`split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py`，并传 `robot:=taku`，不是 "
"`demo.launch.py`。不在 `main` 上，也不是该分支品牌表中的一行。"

